Sanka Migrate monorepo — per-package licensing
==============================================

This repository contains packages under different licenses. The
SPDX-License-Identifier header in each source file is authoritative.

  packages/sanka-migrate-connector-sdk/   Apache-2.0       (LICENSE file in that directory)
  packages/sanka-migrate/         AGPL-3.0-only    (LICENSE file in that directory)
  connectors/                     Apache-2.0
  scripts/, tests/, docs/         Apache-2.0

The full license texts are in each package directory's LICENSE file.

The Sanka Migrate Runtime (packages/sanka-migrate) is also available under a
commercial license from Sanka, Inc. for use without AGPL-3.0 obligations —
see docs/legal/commercial-license.md (draft).

All contributions require a signed Contributor License Agreement; see
CONTRIBUTING.md.
